  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.7268542004749179\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">吳正任</span></b><br />\n<b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">用歌聲ia̍h目屎</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kā lia̍p圓tēⁿ扁</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lóng隨在你</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(伊已經變形)</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></b><br />\n<a name='more'></a><b style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bih tī頭殼內</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">興tshit-thô ê mi̍h</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">啥時tsūn beh提來sńg</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lóng隨在你</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">(伊無所不至)</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">仝款是「過去」</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">沓沓仔沉底</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">是稀微 &nbsp;歡喜</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ku tī心肝窟仔</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">無張持</span><br /><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">抽--一-下 &nbsp;抽--一-下</span><br /><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">是刻骨ê傷悲</span></div>\n</b>"
